{"lines": ["Three prisoners vanished from Alcatraz, leaving painted dummy heads with real hair in their beds.", "On June eleventh, nineteen sixty-two, Frank Morris and brothers John and Clarence Anglin squeezed through widened cell vents inside the San Francisco Bay prison, and paddled away on a raft stitched from more than fifty stolen raincoats.", "But a two thousand fourteen Delft University tide model found a narrow thirty-minute launch window that could reach shore.", "A raft leaving between eleven thirty p.m. and midnight could have reached Horseshoe Bay, just north of the Golden Gate Bridge.", "In two thousand thirteen, San Francisco police received a letter signed John Anglin, claiming all three made it.", "The FBI's handwriting, fingerprint and DNA tests on it were inconclusive.", "Its official finding, in nineteen seventy-nine, was that the men drowned.", "Their bodies were never found. Nobody explained it."], "words": [["Three", 0.0, 0.2], ["prisoners", 0.2, 0.56], ["vanished", 0.56, 0.98], ["from", 0.98, 1.34], ["Alcatraz,", 1.34, 1.88], ["leaving", 2.32, 2.58], ["painted", 2.58, 3.0], ["dummy", 3.0, 3.34], ["heads", 3.34, 3.7], ["with", 3.7, 3.94], ["real", 3.94, 4.16], ["hair", 4.16, 4.58], ["in", 4.58, 4.76], ["their", 4.76, 4.88], ["beds.", 4.88, 5.12], ["On", 5.959, 6.1], ["June", 6.1, 6.28], ["eleventh,", 6.28, 6.72], ["nineteen", 6.72, 7.16], ["sixty-two,", 7.16, 7.6], ["Frank", 8.2, 8.52], ["Morris", 8.52, 8.86], ["and", 8.86, 9.2], ["brothers", 9.2, 9.46], ["John", 9.46, 9.8], ["and", 9.8, 10.12], ["Clarence", 10.12, 10.48], ["Anglin", 10.48, 10.98], ["squeezed", 10.98, 11.58], ["through", 11.58, 12.18], ["widened", 12.18, 12.54], ["cell", 12.54, 12.9], ["vents", 12.9, 13.2], ["inside", 13.2, 13.64], ["the", 13.64, 13.86], ["San", 13.86, 14.08], ["Francisco", 14.08, 14.5], ["Bay", 14.5, 14.86], ["prison,", 14.86, 15.14], ["and", 15.14, 15.78], ["paddled", 15.78, 16.18], ["away", 16.18, 16.42], ["on", 16.42, 16.66], ["a", 16.66, 16.72], ["raft", 